{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sphie and Lyon, two rookie adventurers, set out on the <i>Trial of Blessings</i>, a path where the Blessing Spirit awaits, hoping to prove themselves as true adventurers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short-form SRPG with <strong>6 stages \u00d7 2 routes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is <strong>no game over</strong>.<br>(Even if an player unit\u2019s HP drops to 0, they return after 2 turns with half HP.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units have only 5 parameters: <strong>HP, TP, ATK, DEF, and MOV</strong>.<br>All attacks always hit\u2014no criticals.<br>Level-up growth is fixed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each unit has a <strong>Red, Blue, or Green element</strong>, forming a rock\u2013paper\u2013scissors style triangle that increases or reduces damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating an enemy lets <strong>all player units act again</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score is calculated based on your performance at the end of each stage.<br>(<i>Includes an online scoreboard feature!</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage is designed to take about <strong>5\u201310 minutes</strong>.<br>While the overall difficulty is casual and beginner-friendly, chasing a high score brings a puzzle-like challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, the game is packed with plenty of <strong>Kawaii vibes</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Tools Used</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SRPG Studio</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032600?t=1759316333","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032600/ac660685dd9edec35095d57f762fb83d2556ff96/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759316333","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032600/e432d85a1bb43fbe1baed70ba91a12cb0d182d4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759316333","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032600/e432d85a1bb43fbe1baed70ba91a12cb0d182d4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759316333","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,4,5],"notes":"This content is not suitable for all ages. It includes nudity and sexual themes."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sphie and Lyon, two rookie adventurers, set out on the <i>Trial of Blessings</i>, a path where the Blessing Spirit awaits, hoping to prove themselves as true adventurers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short-form SRPG with <strong>6 stages \u00d7 2 routes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is <strong>no game over</strong>.<br>(Even if an player unit\u2019s HP drops to 0, they return after 2 turns with half HP.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units have only 5 parameters: <strong>HP, TP, ATK, DEF, and MOV</strong>.<br>All attacks always hit\u2014no criticals.<br>Level-up growth is fixed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each unit has a <strong>Red, Blue, or Green element</strong>, forming a rock\u2013paper\u2013scissors style triangle that increases or reduces damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating an enemy lets <strong>all player units act again</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score is calculated based on your performance at the end of each stage.<br>(<i>Includes an online scoreboard feature!</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage is designed to take about <strong>5\u201310 minutes</strong>.<br>While the overall difficulty is casual and beginner-friendly, chasing a high score brings a puzzle-like challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, the game is packed with plenty of <strong>Kawaii vibes</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Tools Used</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SRPG Studio</p>","developers":["\u6d77\u306e\u304a\u9b5a\u30d1\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30fc"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032600/f7098adacd827918c7be4110e595f538947311d8/header.jpg?t=1759316333","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4032600/1850405915/6608a0d9cb4937333e609b8030404e61c4090b66/1757825334/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759316332","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4032600/1850405915/6608a0d9cb4937333e609b8030404e61c4090b66/1757825334/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759316332","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4032600/1850405915/6608a0d9cb4937333e609b8030404e61c4090b66/1757825334/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759316332","id":257197278,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197278/movie480.mp4?t=1759316332","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.c